ment","shared_sources":"n/a"},"needs_research":[],"would_satisfy_once_confirmed":["original_text","clause_inventory","ending_or_current_basis","counterevidence"]},"shared_sources":[],"signing_dates_seen":{"fr-originals@jobs/fr-originals/output":"1983-02-14","later-events_catalog":"1983-02-14","stage19_causal_queue":"1983-02-14"},"source_ladder_exhausted_proposed":[],"status":"MACHINE DRAFT - UNVERIFIED; not a claim; see jobs/claim-drafts/AGENT_GUIDE.md"},"claim":{"instrument_id":"EO:12405","later_source_search":[],"operative_clauses":[{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"hood of Locomotive Engineers\nÀ dispute exists between the Consolidated Rail Corporation and the Brother­\nhood of Locomotive Engineers.\nThe dispute has not heretofore been adjusted Under the provisions of the  \nRailway Labor Act, as amended (“the Act”).\nThis dispute, in the judgment of the National Mediation Board, threatens  \nsubstantially to interrupt interstate commerce to a degree such as to deprive a \nsection of the country of essential transportation service:","original_source":{"page_or_item":"48 FR 6889, PDF pages 11-11; operative words before the numbered sections","sha256":"76be5297be5b350dfe1ed3e9eb24d78b244d15a93605a45b2bde796aba478011","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1983-02-16/pdf/FR-1983-02-16.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:12405#preamble-op","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"1-101. Establishment o f Board. There is established, effective immediately,  \na board of three members to be appointed by the President to investigate this \ndispute. No member shall be pecuniarily or otherwise interested in any  \norganization of railroad employees or any carrier.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"48 FR 6889, PDF pages 11-11; Sec. 1-101","sha256":"76be5297be5b350dfe1ed3e9eb24d78b244d15a93605a45b2bde796aba478011","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1983-02-16/pdf/FR-1983-02-16.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:12405#sec1-101","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"1-102. Report  The board shall report its findings to the President with respect \nto the dispute within 30 days of its creation.\n1— 103. Maintaining Conditions. As provided by Section T O  of the Act, as  \namended, from the date of the creation of the Emergency Board, and for 30  \ndays after the board has made its report to the President, no change, except by \nagreement of the parties, shall be made by the carrier or by the employees, in \nthe conditions out of which the dispute arose.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"48 FR 6889, PDF pages 11-11; Sec. 1-102","sha256":"76be5297be5b350dfe1ed3e9eb24d78b244d15a93605a45b2bde796aba478011","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1983-02-16/pdf/FR-1983-02-16.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:12405#sec1-102","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"1-104. Expiration. The Emergency Board shall terminate upon submission of  \nthe report provided for in paragraph 1-102 of this Order.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"48 FR 6889, PDF pages 11-11; Sec. 1-104","sha256":"76be5297be5b350dfe1ed3e9eb24d78b244d15a93605a45b2bde796aba478011","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1983-02-16/pdf/FR-1983-02-16.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:12405#sec1-104","state_at_cutoff":null}],"original_representation":{"page_or_item":"48 FR 6889, PDF pages 11-11","sha256":"76be5297be5b350dfe1ed3e9eb24d78b244d15a93605a45b2bde796aba478011","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1983-02-16/pdf/FR-1983-02-16.pdf"},"research_rationale":"","savings_residuals":null,"schema":"eo-lifecycle-claim/v1","unresolved_material_gaps":["DRAFT: state_at_cutoff not decided for 4 clause(s); clause inventory completeness not confirmed","DRAFT: whole-order ending not established","DRAFT: savings and residual effects not